    "body": "fix on issue/1568-step-cap-headroom · PR #1578 · pinned by step_guard::tests::the_cap_keeps_headroom_over_the_heaviest_measured_healthy_face, a_smooth_face_needing_more_than_the_old_cap_is_divided_not_tripped (heavy lane), a_division_outside_the_surface_range_is_flagged; import_step_guard::a_finer_pass_that_runs_out_on_a_smooth_face_keeps_the_coarser_mesh, a_finer_pass_that_runs_out_on_a_face_that_may_jump_is_refused; step_refine::tests::a_finer_pass_tripping_* · merges when reviewed. Cap 150 M (fixed); a finer pass over a face proven continuous (from its definition, divided inside its own range) keeps the coarser mesh; 10208.STEP at 60 M imports 14,866,333 facets again; sc_logo.step refused by name in 14.9 s.",
